  <title>Getting started</title>
  <steps>
    <item><p>Open <guiseq><gui>Activities</gui><gui>Demo</gui></guiseq>.</p></item>
    <item><p>Press <keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>N</key></keyseq>.</p></item>
  </steps>
  <note style="tip"><p>Widgets are saved automatically.</p></note>
  <if:choose>
    <if:when test="platform:unity"><p>Unity only.</p></if:when>
    <if:else><p>On GNOME and Helix, use the Activities overview.</p></if:else>
  </if:choose>
  <code>demo --new-widget</code>
  <p>Visit <link href="https://example.org/">the website</link>.</p>
